<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover" />
<title>Whitby Constabulary — Memo</title>
<style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }

    html, body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        background: #0a0705;
        font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        color: #d9c58f;
        overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    body {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 30px 20px;
        opacity: 0;
        transition: opacity .5s ease;
        background:
            radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, #1a130a 0%, #0a0705 70%);
    }
    body.ready { opacity: 1; }

    .memo {
        max-width: 620px;
        width: 100%;
        background: linear-gradient(160deg, #1c1410 0%, #120c07 100%);
        border: 1px solid #6b4a25;
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 34px 30px 28px;
        box-shadow:
            0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.7),
            0 0 0 4px rgba(107, 74, 37, 0.15),
            inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        position: relative;
    }

    /* Aged paper corner accents */
    .memo::before,
    .memo::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        width: 22px;
        height: 22px;
        border: 1px solid #8a6e42;
    }
    .memo::before { top: 12px; left: 12px; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; }
    .memo::after  { bottom: 12px; right: 12px; border-left: none; border-top: none; }

    .letterhead {
        text-align: center;
        padding-bottom: 20px;
        border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(138, 110, 66, 0.45);
        margin-bottom: 22px;
    }
    .crest {
        font-size: 2rem;
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 14px rgba(240, 180, 41, 0.5));
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .constabulary {
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.35em;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #eace9f;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .dept {
        font-size: 0.62rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.28em;
        color: #8a6e42;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .memo-meta {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        padding-bottom: 20px;
        border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(138, 110, 66, 0.30);
    }
    .meta-row {
        display: flex;
        gap: 14px;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        align-items: baseline;
    }
    .meta-row .label {
        color: #8a6e42;
        letter-spacing: 0.22em;
        font-weight: bold;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        min-width: 48px;
    }
    .meta-row .value {
        color: #d9c58f;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }

    .memo-body {
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
        color: #c9b585;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .memo-body p {
        margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .memo-body p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .memo-body strong {
        color: #eace9f;
        font-weight: bold;
    }
    .memo-body em {
        color: #b09a70;
        font-style: italic;
    }

    .memo-sign {
        text-align: right;
        padding-top: 18px;
        border-top: 1px dashed rgba(138, 110, 66, 0.30);
        margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .sign-name {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        color: #eace9f;
        font-style: italic;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        margin-bottom: 2px;
    }
    .sign-title {
        font-size: 0.66rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.24em;
        color: #8a6e42;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .continue-btn {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        padding: 16px 20px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #d99a1a, #a37812);
        border: 1px solid #ffd066;
        border-radius: 12px;
        color: #1a1006;
        font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: 0.20em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        cursor: pointer;
        box-shadow:
            0 8px 22px rgba(240, 180, 41, 0.35),
            inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
        transition: transform 0.08s, box-shadow 0.15s;
    }
    .continue-btn:hover {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffd066, #d99a1a);
    }
    .continue-btn:active {
        transform: translateY(2px);
        box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(240, 180, 41, 0.35);
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
        body { padding: 20px 12px; }
        .memo { padding: 24px 20px 20px; }
        .crest { font-size: 1.7rem; }
        .constabulary { font-size: 0.76rem; letter-spacing: 0.28em; }
        .memo-body { font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.7; }
        .meta-row { font-size: 0.72rem; }
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="memo">
    <div class="letterhead">
        <div class="crest">⚖️</div>
        <div class="constabulary">WHITBY CONSTABULARY</div>
        <div class="dept">Criminal Investigation Department</div>
    </div>

    <div class="memo-meta">
        <div class="meta-row"><span class="label">FROM</span><span class="value">Chief Inspector Ashworth</span></div>
        <div class="meta-row"><span class="label">TO</span><span class="value">Detective</span></div>
        <div class="meta-row"><span class="label">RE</span><span class="value">Captain Hale Case — Preliminary Lead</span></div>
        <div class="meta-row"><span class="label">REF</span><span class="value">WH-2024-06</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="memo-body">
        <p>Detective,</p>

        <p>The Hale jewellery case is officially reopened. <strong>Six pieces</strong> — all believed lost for four centuries — have resurfaced in the last fortnight, and every one of them has vanished again.</p>

        <p>I've been through the archive's sign-in records. One name keeps appearing at the wrong times. <strong>Harold Pryce</strong> — night archivist at the Lincoln Record Office. Twenty years in the post. No priors. But his finances tell a different story, and the timing doesn't sit right with me.</p>

        <p>Bring him in. Ask him about the Vale research permits, and see how he handles the question.</p>

        <p><em>You'll know the rest when you see it.</em></p>
    </div>

    <div class="memo-sign">
        <div class="sign-name">— CI Ashworth</div>
        <div class="sign-title">Chief Inspector</div>
    </div>

    <button class="continue-btn" id="continueBtn">Continue →</button>
</div>

<script>
(function () {
    'use strict';

    // Mark the memo as seen so it doesn't show again
    try { localStorage.setItem('ashworth_memo_seen', '1'); } catch (e) {}

    // Fade in
    function markReady() { document.body.classList.add('ready'); }
    window.addEventListener('load', markReady);
    if (document.readyState === 'complete') markReady();

    document.getElementById('continueBtn').addEventListener('click', function () {
        document.body.style.transition = 'opacity .3s ease';
        document.body.style.opacity = '0';
        setTimeout(function () {
            window.location.href = 'desk.html';
        }, 320);
    });
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
